User: In the diagram, $AB = 25 \mbox{ cm},$ $AC = 20 \mbox{ cm},$ and $\angle A = 90^\circ.$ What is the area of triangle $ABC?$

[asy]
draw((0,0)--(25,0)--(0,20)--cycle,black+linewidth(1));
draw((0,0)--(1,0)--(1,1)--(0,1)--cycle,black+linewidth(1));
